From: Oleksii Kulinich <entaytion@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:05:12 +0300
Subject: Add Pill Stack: interactive pills in the chats search bar

Ported from exteraGram/exteraless. Clock, weather, cache size, proxy
status, Ghost Mode toggle, RAM/CPU/net-speed/DC-ping telemetry,
battery, free storage, and live currency/crypto rates (BTC, ETH, gold,
TON, any fiat pair). Configurable which pills show, how many at once,
and the rate pairs, from Settings -> Pill Stack.
---
 .../java/org/telegram/ui/Components/FragmentSearchField.java  | 3 +++
 .../src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/DialogsActivity.java        | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/Components/FragmentSearchField.java b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/ui/Components/FragmentSearchField.java
